---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Projects — Reverie Archive"
  description="XAzusaX 的網站、工具與持續進行中的實驗。"
>
  <main class="projects-page">
    <header class="projects-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Archive · Project index</p>
      <h1>Projects</h1>
      <p>一些已完成、正在整理，或還在慢慢成形的作品。</p>
    </header>

    <section class="project-section" aria-labelledby="active-projects">
      <div class="project-section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Active records</p>
        <h2 id="active-projects">進行中的專案</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="project-grid">
        <a class="project-card project-card-featured project-card-link" id="elements" href="/projects/elements">
          <div class="project-card-topline">
            <span>01</span>
            <span class="project-status is-live">線上運作中</span>
          </div>

          <p class="project-type">學習工具 · 化學</p>
          <h3>元素探索者</h3>
          <p>
            一個以元素週期表為入口的學生資料庫。每個元素都有可快速查閱的基本性質、電子組態、用途與相關元素。
          </p>

          <div class="project-card-footer">
            <span>開啟元素探索者</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>